<title>MEXICO: Autlan 1997 Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Autlan 1997 Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997		     Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income	16.52 million		76.07 million</p>
<p>	Net		  54.41 million		68.66 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 242.60 million	     312.49 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   1.09 million	 gain  7.05 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos. Full company name is Compania Minera Autlan SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
